      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5aab30ea0b6da707273dbb98|full_name}: 毎日VRChatにログインできるわけではなく、今まで休日にまとめてチェックしておりました。今の状態だと毎日入ることを強制される量しか表示されません。せめて1週間分くらいは見れると助かります。(今までは2週間分でも表示されました。)\n\nI am not able to log in to VRChat every day and have been checking it collectively on my days off. As it stands now, I only see the amount that I am forced to enter each day. It would be helpful to be able to see at least a week's worth. (Up until now, even 2 weeks worth was shown.)",
